ossible...\n\n(making a general comment because I'm getting an internal error and can't comment on the line)","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855#pullrequestreview-4238132738","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118855","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-05-06T17:17:49Z"},{"id":4238204934,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc78neAG","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"a7de4f7ca026e5183edfb016d3f2a08970bc6084","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Looks good to me, aside of stylistic changes.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855#pullrequestreview-4238204934","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118855","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-05-06T17:28:33Z"},{"id":4238589662,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc78o77e","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"a7de4f7ca026e5183edfb016d3f2a08970bc6084","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95504962?u=80438adc5ffbc7bbf00b64757b445f273cf333b2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Akosmo","id":95504962,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbFKQg","login":"Akosmo","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akosmo"},"body":"Speaking as someone who only started contributing during the development of 4.7, has seen many different PRs at this point, and also frequents meetings.\n\nThis looks good to me, and I agree with your points.\nI have seen many PRs that barely explain the changes made, if at all. Prompting an explanation at any degree is a great start at least! Otherwise it can be hard to tell what changes were made, which considerations were taken into account, and specially which problems are fixed by the PR. An explanation would help reviews for sure.\n\nHopefully the AI line has some effect.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855#pullrequestreview-4238589662","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118855","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-05-06T18:37:45Z"}]